            "body": "please keep the error on the state:\n\n```lua\n---@class (private) nvim.dir.State\n---@field gen integer\n---@field err? string\n---@field provider? nvim.dir.Provider\n```\n\nerr dies in `on_list`. you notify it, then commit `{ gen, provider }`, which is identical to a successful empty listing. i prefer that you store it on the state, & clear it on next list\n\nmatters for #40458 also",
